      "char_count": 86,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.00155_p4_b16",
      "text": "group-normalized rollout probabilities, the resulting method requires only minimal changes\nto GRPO implementations [Shao et al., 2024] and gives the strongest over-optimization\nmitigation among the baselines we test.\n",
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
